<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 8-11.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 8-11.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set the</p>
<p>following exchange rates for August 8-11. The kroon is pegged at</p>
<p>eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	     August 8-11    August 7/8</p>
<p>    CZK     0.43482	  0.43305</p>
<p>    DKK     2.09993	  2.09907</p>
<p>    FIM     2.67388	  2.68523</p>
<p>    GBP    23.84775	 24.02525</p>
<p>    HUF     0.07496	  0.07533</p>
<p>    LTL     3.74394	  3.761</p>
<p>    LVL    25.29135	 25.41216</p>
<p>    RUR     0.00258	  0.00259</p>
<p>    SEK     1.85856	  1.85866</p>
<p>    UAH     8.07809	  8.10124</p>
<p>    USD    14.9788	  15.044</p>
<p>    XEU    15.71426	 15.75107</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
